WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 20 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.850
I'm sorry, Duke Valmon.

2
00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:09.530
I let you down.

3
00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:11.530
But I told you from the start...

4
00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:14.250
I'm a nobody.

5
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.380
No, Aris.

6
00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:21.380
You risked your life to save me and Beatrix.

7
00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:26.580
You have more courage than any element-wielding dragon knight I have ever known.

8
00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:28.580
What a pathetic, delusional old man.

9
00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:30.580
Aris is a servant.

10
00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:31.780
And he always will be.

11
00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:32.980
Lucky for me.

12
00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:35.980
I've never wasted a single second on that stray dog.

13
00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:37.380
Tragic.

14
00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:38.380
Truly.

15
00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:40.380
Caspian.

16
00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:43.380
If I were blessed with a prodigy for a daughter,

17
00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:46.380
I'd never chain a deadweight like him around her neck.

18
00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:51.380
B, did you forget every single thing I taught you?

19
00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:53.380
Power without heart is a curse.

20
00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:56.380
That old man's so utterly blind.

21
00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:58.380
No wonder the Valmonts are a dying breed.

22
00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.380
Let us put an end to this farce.

23
00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:03.380
I, Beatrix, am formally severing my engagement

24
00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:07.380
to this lowly servant Aris.

25
00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:10.380
This is the crest of House Valmont.

26
00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:12.380
I used to wear it with pride.

27
00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:15.380
But a house that embraces weakness over true power

28
00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:18.380
is a deadweight I refuse to carry.

29
00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:21.380
Duke Valmont, from this second forward,

30
00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:23.380
I am no longer your daughter.

31
00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:27.380
I belong at the top, and you can rot at the bottom.
